{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And two boards you shall make for the corners.</b> One for the northwest corner and one for the southwest — all eight boards are in a single row, except that these two are not within the interior of the Mishkan; rather, half a cubit from this side and half a cubit from that side are visible inside, to complete its width to ten. And the cubit from this side and the cubit from that side correspond to the cubit of thickness of the Mishkan boards of the north and south, so that the corner be flush from the outside."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:54:47.774038073Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}